 *   **Performance:** On the 'lego' scene with 6 views, MELON achieves a PSNR of 35.4 and a mean angular error of 0.901°, outperforming GNeRF (PSNR 35.3, error 1.21°) and failing COLMAP [S1].
-*   **Strengths:** Does not require CNN pre-training or pose initialization (ab-initio) [S1]. Does not require a discriminator (unlike GNeRF) [S1]. Robust to small datasets (works with as few as 6 views) [S1].
-*   **Limitations:** Fails when translation is unknown ($SE(3)$) [S1]. Requires known intrinsics and object-to-camera distance [S1].
